17306563939.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pond-pump-with-float17306563939.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Submersible Pond Pump with Float</h1>\n<p>The 100SCM pump refers to the submersible pond pump with float. Usually, it is applied to the farm irrigation. Farmers use it to irrigate fields and raise up vegetables and plants. And this pump is installed horizontally. 1. Product Specification 2. Performance Curve 3. Spare Parts 4. Company...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52149911\"/></p><p>The 100SCM pump refers to the submersible pond pump with float. Usually, it is applied to the farm irrigation. Farmers use it to irrigate fields and raise up vegetables and plants. And this pump is installed horizontally. <br/></p><p><strong>1. Product Specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Horsepower (HP)</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">0.5-2</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Horsepower (KW)</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">0.37-1.5</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">RPM</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">2850</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Twelve moths</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Volts</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220-240/380-415V~50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Insulation class</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Q MAX</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">5.8 (m³/h)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">585-855mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Shaft Dia</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">12 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Application</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1. Water supply system <br/>2. Booster<br/>3. Garden and farm irrigation<br/>4. Lowering underground water level<br/>5. Various industrial applications</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Package</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plywood or Carton (with or without plastic foam)</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Power Source</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Electric</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Submersible</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Yes</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Max Head</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">94m</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909369175173.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240907529011824.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909436681618.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Company Profile</strong></p><p>For over 25 years, JIADI pump industry has been the supplier and cooperator of many customers from all over the world. JIADI is a company specialized in the fabrication of various kinds of submersible water pumps like screw pump, multistage pump and so on. Now JIADI has been recognized as one of the best pump companies in this area. We will keep on developing and creating more and more quality pumps.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909506886824.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Our Benefits</strong></p><p>Firstly, we will try our best to manufacture the quality pumps to bring you convenience and comfort, which is the essential function we will play.</p><p>Secondly, we will accept all the questions you put forward humbly and handle all of them immediately.</p><p>Thirdly, we will strive to achieve the general goal of our company, which refers to customer first and quality oriented.</p><p>Besides, we will offer you the reasonable and competitive price for we are manufactures and we won’t ask you for extra fee like resale price. </p><p><strong>6. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Port: Shanghai, Ningbo and Lianyugang</p><p>Lead time: Normally, it will cost 20-30 days for the ship to deliver your goods. Any exceptional cases will be informed timely.</p><p>Details: Each pump will be packed in one box which could be carton or wooden box.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909547759415.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Product Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240909571261840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808240910014421578.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">GS</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO9001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">RoHS</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The acquisition of these certificates cost our time and energy and can be the best proof of our quality pumps, which can meet the requirements of our customers.</p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: What kind of payment terms will you accept?</strong></p><p>A: Usually we accept T/T, D/P, D/A, L/C, Western Union or PayPal.</p><p><strong>2. Q: What's your MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Sample for testing is available.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Do I need to install a pump?</strong></p><p>A: A pump can bring you good tap pressure and a convenience life. If there is enough head pressure in the tank then maybe you do not need a pump. However, with a pump you can have a better life. </p><p><strong>4. Q: What is the actual diameter of a 4-inch well pump? Will it fit inside my 4\" diameter well casing?</strong></p><p>A: The diameter of 4SR 4\" submersible well pump is 3.86\" (3-7/8\"). It will fit in a straight 4'well properly.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: submersible pond pump with float, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-built-in-submersible-pond-pump-with-float/automatic-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Automatic Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/automatic-submersible-pump17481564776a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-built-in-submersible-pond-pump-with-float/automatic-submersible-pump\">Automatic Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-peripheral-submersible-pump/stainless-steel-periph